WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.747
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind sketch a simple community map.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:11.694
Map: shows positions and places in an area. Symbol: stands for a place or feature.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:17.803
Key: explains what map symbols mean. Direction: helps describe where to move. Scale:

00:00:17.803 --> 00:00:21.451
shows the relation between map distance and real distance.

00:00:22.283 --> 00:00:26.987
Collect a few harmless facts about classroom materials, NOT personal details. Make a

00:00:26.987 --> 00:00:31.691
paper chart with the terms Map, Symbol and Key; explain what each means.
